            <div xml:id="d415">

                <pb facs="0682" n="578" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg578"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.654/63: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Italy
                        (Garrett)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-02-28T14:00:00-05:00">February 28,
                            1933—2 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>10. Your No. 7, February 23, 11 a.m. Full powers will be forwarded by the next
                    pouch.</p>
                <p>You are authorized to sign if our draft is accepted. Should the Italian
                    Government propose any modifications, you are instructed to submit them to the
                    Department for approval.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
